        defEn: "You encounter an impossible situation — reversed causality, self-reference, or two equally real but contradictory facts. Reason crashes here.",
        core: "A面：悖论也许是理性的最高级形式——它正在试图处理一个比它自身更大的东西。你的大脑死机了，但你的灵魂在前进。/ B面：思维的死锁——你无法停止思考这个问题，但你越思考就越深陷。它像一个永远在旋转的加载图标。关键张力：如果'真'和'假'可以同时存在——那逻辑本身还有用吗？ | 实在界入侵(Tuche): 宇宙不欠你一个'合理'的解释——它完全有可能是建立在矛盾之上的。",
        coreEn: "A-side: Paradox may be reason's highest form — it's trying to process something bigger than itself. Your brain crashes, but your soul advances. / B-side: Cognitive deadlock — you can't stop thinking about it, but the more you think, the deeper you sink. Like a loading icon spinning forever. Key tension: If 'true' and 'false' can coexist — is logic itself still useful? | Real punctured: The universe doesn't owe you a 'logical' explanation — it may very well be built on contradiction.",
